'''Machamp''' (Japanese: '''カイリキー''' ''Kairiky'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Shining Revelry}} expansion.

