==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Shining Revelry}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Plasma Blast|Machamp|50}} from the {{TCG|Plasma Blast}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Stormfront|Machamp|20}} from the {{TCG|Stormfront}} expansion.
*'''Power Press''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Sandaconda|110}} from the {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

